Data sources read at runtime
----------------------------

Weather-or-Not reads these sources only through Zetaris. No bulk data from
them is distributed in this repository.

SEC EDGAR (U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission)
  XBRL frames, companyconcept and submissions APIs at data.sec.gov.
  A work of the U.S. government, public domain. Read live under the SEC
  fair-access policy (at most 10 requests per second, with a declared
  User-Agent), never bulk-redistributed. The repository commits no
  extracted SEC data beyond the numbers cited in docs/eval-report.md and
  docs/demo-case.md (growth rates, accession numbers and the two restated
  values of the demo utilities). seeds/utilities.json holds public
  identifiers only (CIK, name, SIC, headquarters state, ticker) with the
  curated states served and station ids.

NOAA GHCN-Daily (National Centers for Environmental Information)
  Parquet files on the Registry of Open Data on AWS, bucket noaa-ghcn-pds,
  by_year/YEAR=<yyyy>/ELEMENT=<TMAX|TMIN>/. CC0 1.0 (a work of the U.S.
  government). Cite: Menne, M.J., I. Durre, B. Korzeniewski, S. McNeill,
  K. Thomas, X. Yin, S. Anthony, R. Ray, R.S. Vose, B.E. Gleason, and
  T.G. Houston, 2012: Global Historical Climatology Network - Daily
  (GHCN-Daily), Version 3. NOAA National Centers for Environmental
  Information. seeds/stations.json holds station ids, names and states
  from ghcnd-stations.txt.

company_dns
  SIC code list served at company-dns.mediumroast.io (V4). The service is
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the SIC codes and
  descriptions are the SEC's. Called with an identifying User-Agent.

Zetaris getting-started repository (optional, at boot)
  https://github.com/zetaris/getting-started, Apache License, Version 2.0.
  When ZETARIS_GETTING_STARTED_DIR is set, its open_data/manifest.json and
  known_to_fail notes are read to seed H-MEM with source notes. Nothing
  from it is redistributed here.


Models and platforms (not redistributed)
----------------------------------------

NVIDIA Nemotron (nemotron-3-nano:4b) runs locally through Ollama under the
NVIDIA Open Model License. The model weights are not redistributed in this
repository.

Zetaris Lightning 2.4.3.1 and its JDBC driver are installed from Zetaris
under Zetaris's terms. Neither is redistributed in this repository.
